<h1>Work Portfolio</h1>
<p>Every project here reflects my belief that great front-end work balances creativity, structure, and performance. From building design systems in Storybook to optimizing user flows with semantic SEO and accessibility in mind, I strive to make the web not just work—but work beautifully. These highlights capture how I approach front-end challenges across teams, tools, and user goals.</p>

<nav id="work-toc" class="work-toc" aria-labelledby="work-toc-heading" tabindex="-1">
  <h2 id="work-toc-heading" class="work-toc__heading">Table of Contents</h2>
  <ul class="work-toc__list">
    {% for study in workStudies %}
      <li><a href="#{{ study.fragment | escape }}">{{ study.tocLabel | escape }}</a></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</nav>

{% for study in workStudies %}
  <section id="{{ study.fragment | escape }}" class="work-project" aria-labelledby="{{ study.fragment | escape }}-heading" tabindex="-1">
    <header>
      <h2 id="{{ study.fragment | escape }}-heading" class="work-project__heading">{{ study.title | escape }}{% if study.titleEmphasis %} <em>{{ study.titleEmphasis | escape }}</em>{% endif %}</h2>
      <p class="work-project__info">{{ study.role | escape }} · {{ study.date | escape }}</p>
      {% for detail in study.details %}
        <p class="work-project__info"><strong>{{ detail.label | escape }}:</strong> {{ detail.text | escape }}</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </header>

    {% include study.template %}

    <a class="work-project__return" href="#work-toc">Return to table of contents</a>
  </section>
  <hr>
{% endfor %}
